cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this dataset or code, please cite it using the metadata below.
  A data paper describing the dataset is under review; the reference will be
  added here on publication.
type: dataset
title: "Urban Tree Soil Moisture Dataset (TreeDataBase)"
abstract: >-
  Georeferenced urban trees across Central European cities equipped with
  IoT soil-moisture sensors at 10, 30 and 45 cm depth, with hourly gridded
  weather data, hand-digitised land-use context at 2.5/5/7.5 m, topographic
  indices, soil laboratory analyses, tree photographs, and derived rain- and
  irrigation-event tables.
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-28
license: MIT
license-url: https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT
keywords:
  - urban trees
  - soil moisture
  - IoT sensors
  - capacitive soil sensors
  - land use
  - topographic wetness index
  - irrigation
  - rain events
  - Central Europe
